<% content_for :title, "RAG Assistant — Will Francis" %>

<div class="page page--home">
  <div class="home-kicker">PORTFOLIO DEMONSTRATION</div>
  <h1 class="home-title">Ask the system how it works.</h1>
  <p class="home-lede">
    This LLM-powered assistant retrieves relevant passages from a collection of documents
    before answering, cites the material it used, and abstains when the collection does not
    support an answer.
  </p>

  <div class="card home-panel">
    <div class="section-title">The collection</div>
    <p>
      The public demo reads a fixed set of documents about its own architecture, retrieval
      strategy, evaluation harness, citations, and deployment. Public uploads are disabled.
    </p>

    <div class="section-title">Questions to try</div>
    <ul class="list-plain home-prompts">
      <li>How does hybrid retrieval work in this project?</li>
      <li>Why does the assistant sometimes refuse to answer?</li>
      <li>How are citations kept valid after documents change?</li>
    </ul>

    <% if current_user %>
      <div class="home-chat-action">
        <%= link_to "start chat", conversations_path, class: "btn" %>
      </div>
    <% elsif @demo_available %>
      <div class="home-chat-action">
        <%= button_to "start chat", demo_session_path, method: :post, class: "btn" %>
      </div>
    <% else %>
      <p class="errors">The curated corpus has not been prepared yet.</p>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <p class="home-links">
    <a href="https://github.com/wbfrancis/rag-assistant">source and technical notes</a>
    <span>·</span>
    <a href="https://willbfrancis.com/">willbfrancis.com</a>
  </p>
</div>
